{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/a93f17d551e841fd82e152d5d463d379.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/a93f17d551e841fd82e152d5d463d379.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=156 /></span>The gods rule the rainforest world \u2014 and they demand bloodshed for their entertainment. Step into the arena as an ambitious young lizard, command your growing legion, and fight your way toward nobility\u2026 or die as the next sacrifice. Choose from <strong>4 distinct origins and faiths</strong>: become a savage warrior devoted to the god of untamed nature, or a ruthless slave master serving the lord of the underworld. Your belief will shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/cf6f49e2b5e6455a69add6bcff20e4c5.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/cf6f49e2b5e6455a69add6bcff20e4c5.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/436335204c30f9ecf66f18f44efee795.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/436335204c30f9ecf66f18f44efee795.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=156 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across <strong>8 grand arenas, 15+ races, and 125+ unique units</strong>. Each campaign unveils new and unexpected enemies: noble legions, barbarian tribes, underworld horrors, grain spirits, alien visitors, clayborn constructs, and even legendary beasts\u2026 Defeat them \u2014 and claim them for your own army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/7f78656822891f6d8dfd3dd8a9dd8c90.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/7f78656822891f6d8dfd3dd8a9dd8c90.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=435 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/de412d956e8a81e5f06e9cf605326891.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/de412d956e8a81e5f06e9cf605326891.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=758 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/9755b412a9073212811f04dfe3afbcea.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/9755b412a9073212811f04dfe3afbcea.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 tactical archetypes,  300+ magical items, 100+ divine blessings, and 50+  status effects</strong> \u2014 the build possibilities are vast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flexible equipment and slot system lets you experiment freely, adapt mid-run, and craft strategies that directly counter your enemies\u2019 weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/00fef9b2216ed627f627e07c7f344ee6.avif?t=1772496470\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/3123fbaef977cda7ea3b330e0f656679.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/3123fbaef977cda7ea3b330e0f656679.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>drop of blood</strong> spilled becomes a precious magical resource. Spend <strong>blood</strong> to summon mythical creatures, unleash devastating spells, or empower your legion \u2014 seize control of the battlefield\u2019s momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running low? Try <strong>sacrificing</strong> your followers \u2014 each unit comes with their own <strong>unique sacrifice voice lines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/cb3dd7eedf46efd13c219fa3da29657a.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/cb3dd7eedf46efd13c219fa3da29657a.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/03510271ee134aa04a530d757295fc60.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/03510271ee134aa04a530d757295fc60.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim the championship to unlock <strong>Endless Mode</strong> and push your strategy to its absolute limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full release will introduce additional challenge modes and new gameplay options</strong> \u2014 including <strong>Custom Battles</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/173ab13f4b5e02e094bd0a112c968a3c.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/173ab13f4b5e02e094bd0a112c968a3c.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=918 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816000?t=1772496470","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/a3be31297da1aae4ffe435b932585c9ed446c6db/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772496470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/1ee5d94b2173c6abb247b782044e92f40111b0f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772496470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/1ee5d94b2173c6abb247b782044e92f40111b0f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772496470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4239480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/a93f17d551e841fd82e152d5d463d379.avif?t=1772496470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/a93f17d551e841fd82e152d5d463d379.webp?t=1772496470 width=1560 height=156 /></span>The gods rule the rainforest world \u2014 and they demand bloodshed for their entertainment. Step into the arena as an ambitious